{"text":"When I finally made it home to Nashville, I told this story to everyone. In fact, I told it for years. Two hours in an airport with a Hare Krishna. But as I got older, I could see myself becoming that Hare Krishna, wanting to testify about the greatest love in my life, which is reading. So great is my need to share this love that it outweighs my significant need for privacy. I gave up printmaking when I left Iowa, but books have been my steadfast companions, my solace, my teachers, my joy. I can't imagine what life would be without reading. And so, pretty much every day in every situation I find myself in, I'm out there sharing the good news.","words":[{"text":"When","start":0.76,"end":1.22},{"text":"I","start":1.22,"end":1.44},{"text":"finally","start":1.44,"end":1.86},{"text":"made","start":1.86,"end":2.12},{"text":"it","start":2.12,"end":2.32},{"text":"home","start":2.32,"end":2.5},{"text":"to","start":2.5,"end":2.72},{"text":"Nashville","start":2.72,"end":3.2,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":3.98,"end":4.28},{"text":"told","start":4.28,"end":4.66},{"text":"this","start":4.66,"end":4.98},{"text":"story","start":4.98,"end":5.48},{"text":"to","start":5.48,"end":6.22},{"text":"everyone","start":6.22,"end":6.9,"punct":"."},{"text":"In","start":7.8,"end":8.02},{"text":"fact","start":8.02,"end":8.32,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":8.38,"end":8.54},{"text":"told","start":8.54,"end":8.76},{"text":"it","start":8.76,"end":9.0},{"text":"for","start":9.0,"end":9.3},{"text":"years","start":9.3,"end":9.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"Two","start":11.34,"end":11.7},{"text":"hours","start":11.7,"end":12.36},{"text":"in","start":12.36,"end":13.52},{"text":"an","start":13.52,"end":13.68},{"text":"airport","start":13.68,"end":14.14},{"text":"with","start":14.14,"end":15.22},{"text":"a","start":15.22,"end":15.36},{"text":"Hare","start":15.36,"end":15.56},{"text":"Krishna","start":15.56,"end":16.1,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":17.72,"end":18.4},{"text":"as","start":18.4,"end"